    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GPT-5.6 Sol on wolfram2002-ch12-05: partially-resolvable, resolvability 0.21";
    dc:description "Selected physical and biological model collections could test a narrow version. Existing data cannot establish that most unconstrained natural rules are effectively random or almost always universal.";
