    dc:type "resolution-route/mixed";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Choose natural domains with inferred mechanistic rules, quantify rule-description complexity and evidence of selection constraints, and compare their distribution with a prespecified random-rule ensemble. Then test computational universality for the matched models where possible.";
